             'auth_scheme':{'type':'string','enum':['Bearer',''],'default':'Bearer'}},['handle','path']),
        'clanker_request_payment':('Request an owner-only card and purchase approval form for the current local checkout. The backend captures its actual origin and checkout contents. Specify the exact merchant, items/quantities and final total including fees. Optional handle selects a saved card. No card details enter chat. Shared requests move to DM. End the turn while waiting; approval resumes it. Cloud browsers cannot receive card data.',
